description:
In repos/development-vessel/src/resolvers/activity-lifecycle-audit.ts, accept two additional timestamp key names when reading a trace row's time.

The file currently contains this exact block:

  if (typeof t.occurred_at === "string") {
    const v = Date.parse(t.occurred_at);
    if (!Number.isNaN(v)) return v;
  }

Immediately after that block, insert these two blocks:

  if (typeof t.completed_at === "string") {
    const v = Date.parse(t.completed_at);
    if (!Number.isNaN(v)) return v;
  }
  if (typeof t.started_at === "string") {
    const v = Date.parse(t.started_at);
    if (!Number.isNaN(v)) return v;
  }

Change nothing else in the file. The two fields already exist on the row type, so this only widens which key names are read.

